[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_01_0010","text":"啊……\n制作人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_01_0020","text":"嘿嘿嘿……你看……\n大发现……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_01_0030","text":"哦，甜甜圈怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_01_0040","text":"这个……\n超～甜的甜甜圈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_01_0050","text":"蘸一下……牛奶的话……\n会更好吃……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_01_0060","text":"恶魔级的……好吃……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_01_0070","text":"哈哈，原来如此啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_01_0080","text":"嗯……\n制作人也……下次，试试看……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_01_0090","text":"甜花觉得……\n巧克力味的……最推荐……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_01_0100","text":"好，我会试试的\n谢谢你的好情报，甜花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500100_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
